{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"32d8fe2811ce367b523515ff1b38833dcd373e2d7a40a25981a491eabe2264ff","digest":{"component_or_area":"autolander long-running service observability and HTTP status endpoint","key_entities":["infra/autolander/loop.py","infra/scripts/observability.sh","infra/terraform/monitoring_autolander.tf","infra/compose/nginx/rebar.conf.template","AUTOLANDER_ERROR marker","AUTOLANDER_HANDBACK marker","autolander_errors metric","autolander_time_to_land_seconds metric","autolander_time_in_phase_seconds metric","heartbeat_age_s field","/autolander/status endpoint","wipChain","Autosubmit"],"problem_keywords":["observability","error visibility","stuck-state detection","heartbeat monitoring","metrics emission","status endpoint","autolander service"],"propositions":["The service lacks a read-only HTTP status endpoint serving queue state (wipChain, time-in-phase, heartbeat age) for remote liveness checks and must expose it at GET /autolander/status via nginx proxy on port 8080.","Unhandled errors and stack hand-backs are not sufficiently visible; the service must emit AUTOLANDER_ERROR and AUTOLANDER_HANDBACK markers (one-line JSON stdout format) counted by observability.sh as rebar/host:autolander_errors metric datapoints.","Wedged-but-alive hangs are not detectable; the service must emit autolander_time_in_phase_seconds as a CloudWatch metric datapoint per poll, with a corresponding alarm in monitoring_autolander.tf to alert on sustained high values.","Time-to-land performance cannot be analyzed; the service must emit autolander_time_to_land_seconds as individual CloudWatch PutMetricData Value datapoints (not StatisticValues) per landed change to enable percentile queries.","Container health state transitions and Docker-level failures are not tracked in CloudWatch; observability.sh must ingest the docker inspect health status and feed it into the autolander_errors metric.","The service must never write session_log and must log exclusively to container stdout for operational transparency."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785822133301531530,"uuid":"efb2b4b2-4a7e-44f7-87a7-af8bddf9b01e"}